{"step_index":132,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-05T09:42:57Z","input_tokens":2617,"cache_read_tokens":164140,"output_tokens":3530,"thinking":"The sandbox environment's \"no new privileges\" flag is active, preventing `sudo` from escalating to root. Network access is also explicitly blocked within the sandbox. This points to a fundamental limitation in executing privileged operations or accessing external resources from within the isolated environment.\n\n\nThe previous analysis focused on `sudo` which is blocked, but there are other avenues such as package managers like `uv`, though it wasn't initially found via `which uv`. The sandbox configuration limits mounted directories, specifically omitting `/home/WORKSTATION4WSL/.local/bin`. Installing packages within the workspace's sandbox-accessible path like `/home/WORKSTATION4WSL/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/mdi_env_rtx5080` avoids `sudo` and provides access inside and outside the sandbox. This enables use of pre-compiled binaries from `conda-forge`, such as `qe`, `lammps`, etc.\n\n\n`numpy`, `scipy`, and `matplotlib` are necessary, and checking for existing `conda` or `uv` installations is a valid first step; if they are not available, `micromamba` or `miniforge` should be installed within the scratch directory. Using `micromamba` within the scratch directory sidesteps `sudo` restrictions. This approach offers full read/write/execute access for tools and libraries.\n\n\nUsing `micromamba` avoids `sudo` and allows installation of key packages and compilers into the scratch directory. The sandbox rules need to be verified to confirm network access, despite initial observations. The plan is to update scripts to utilize the new environment, ensuring it avoids `sudo` and references the correct installation path for all necessary executables.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"#!/bin/bash\n# ==============================================================================\n# setup_local_rtx5080_env.sh\n# 新PC (Core Ultra 9 285K / RAM 64GB / RTX 5080 16GB / Windows 11 Pro WSL2) 用\n# root権限 (sudo) 不要の高速セットアップスクリプト\n# (Micromamba + Conda-Forge により Python, ASE, PyMDI, Quantum ESPRESSO, LAMMPS+MDI を導入)\n# ==============================================================================\nset -e\n\nSCRIPT_DIR=\"$(cd \"$(dirname \"${BASH_SOURCE[0]}\")\" && pwd)\"\nWORKSPACE_DIR=\"$(dirname \"$SCRIPT_DIR\")\"\nENV_PREFIX=\"/home/WORKSTATION4WSL/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/mdi_env_rtx5080\"\nMAMBA_ROOT=\"/home/WORKSTATION4WSL/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/micromamba\"\nMAMBA_BIN=\"$MAMBA_ROOT/bin/micromamba\"\nLOCAL_BIN=\"$SCRIPT_DIR/bin\"\nmkdir -p \"$MAMBA_ROOT/bin\" \"$LOCAL_BIN\"\n\necho \"============================================================\"\necho \" Step 1: Micromamba パッケージマネージャの導入 (sudo 不要)\"\necho \"============================================================\"\nif [ ! -x \"$MAMBA_BIN\" ]; then\n    curl -Ls https://micro.mamba.pm/api/micromamba/linux-64/latest | tar -xvj -C \"$MAMBA_ROOT/bin\" --strip-components=1 bin/micromamba\n    chmod +x \"$MAMBA_BIN\"\nfi\necho \"✅ Micromamba ready: $MAMBA_BIN\"\n\necho \"============================================================\"\necho \" Step 2: 科学計算・第一原理環境 ($ENV_PREFIX) の構築\"\necho \"         (Python 3.11, NumPy, SciPy, Matplotlib, ASE, PyMDI, QE, CMake, OpenMPI)\"\necho \"============================================================\"\nif [ ! -d \"$ENV_PREFIX/conda-meta\" ]; then\n    \"$MAMBA_BIN\" create -y -p \"$ENV_PREFIX\" -c conda-forge \\\n        python=3.11 numpy scipy matplotlib ase pymdi \\\n        qe lammps openmpi cmake make cxx-compiler fortran-compiler pkg-config\nelse\n    echo \"✅ Environment $ENV_PREFIX already exists.\"\nfi\n\nexport PATH=\"$LOCAL_BIN:$ENV_PREFIX/bin:$PATH\"\nexport LD_LIBRARY_PATH=\"$ENV_PREFIX/lib:${LD_LIBRARY_PATH:-}\"\n\necho \"============================================================\"\necho \" Step 3: 論文・Word グラフ用フォント (MS明朝 / Times New Roman) 配置\"\necho \"============================================================\"\nfor f in \"$WORKSPACE_DIR/msmincho.ttc\" \"$WORKSPACE_DIR/times.ttf\" \"$WORKSPACE_DIR/環境設定・フォント/msmincho.ttc\" \"$WORKSPACE_DIR/環境設定・フォント/times.ttf\"; do\n    if [ -f \"$f\" ]; then\n        cp \"$f\" \"$SCRIPT_DIR/\" 2>/dev/null || true\n    fi\ndone\necho \"✅ Fonts copied to calculation directory.\"\n\necho \"============================================================\"\necho \" Step 4: LAMMPS (-mdi 対応確認 & 必要時 24コア高速ビルド)\"\necho \"============================================================\"\nif \"$ENV_PREFIX/bin/lmp\" -h 2>/dev/null | grep -qi \"mdi\"; then\n    ln -sf \"$ENV_PREFIX/bin/lmp\" \"$LOCAL_BIN/lmp\"\n    echo \"✅ Conda-forge LAMMPS already supports MDI ($LOCAL_BIN/lmp)\"\nelse\n    echo \"Building LAMMPS with PKG_MDI=ON using Core Ultra 9 285K (24 threads)...\"\n    BUILD_ROOT=\"/home/WORKSTATION4WSL/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/lammps_mdi_build\"\n    mkdir -p \"$BUILD_ROOT\"\n    if [ ! -d \"$BUILD_ROOT/lammps\" ]; then\n        git clone --depth 1 -b release https://github.com/lammps/lammps.git \"$BUILD_ROOT/lammps\"\n    fi\n    mkdir -p \"$BUILD_ROOT/lammps/build\"\n    cd \"$BUILD_ROOT/lammps/build\"\n    cmake ../cmake \\\n        -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release \\\n        -DCMAKE_PREFIX_PATH=\"$ENV_PREFIX\" \\\n        -DBUILD_MPI=ON \\\n        -DBUILD_OMP=ON \\\n        -DPKG_MDI=ON \\\n        -DPKG_MANYBODY=ON \\\n        -DPKG_MOLECULE=ON\n    cmake --build . -j \"$(nproc)\"\n    cp lmp \"$LOCAL_BIN/lmp\"\n    cp lmp \"$ENV_PREFIX/bin/lmp\"\n    echo \"✅ LAMMPS (PKG_MDI=ON) built and installed to $LOCAL_BIN/lmp\"\nfi\n\nln -sf \"$ENV_PREFIX/bin/pw.x\" \"$LOCAL_BIN/pw.x\"\n\necho \"============================================================\"\necho \" 🎉 セットアップ完了！\"\necho \"  - Python : $(which python3)\"\necho \"  - pw.x   : $(which pw.x)\"\necho \"  - lmp    : $(which lmp)\"\necho \"===========================================================