{"step_index":152,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-05T09:51:45Z","input_tokens":2579,"cache_read_tokens":172765,"output_tokens":2228,"thinking":"Initial investigation reveals the environment creation command utilizes `micromamba` version `2.10.0`. It aims to create an environment at a specified prefix, installing a suite of scientific computing packages including Python 3.11, NumPy, SciPy, and others, along with build tools such as CMake and Make. The command's full intent appears to be setting up a development environment for scientific simulations.\n\n\nThe environment creation command encounters potential conflict due to differing dependency constraints for `qe`, `lammps`, and the scientific Python packages when combined in a single environment. Installing the Python packages via `pip` separately from `qe` might bypass this issue, as `pip` handles prebuilt wheels without conda's solver. Separate environment creation for `qe` and `lammps` could also avoid complex solver interactions, given the faster resolution time for individual packages.\n\n\nThe existing system setup includes essential build tools and Python already, which suggests that relying solely on `micromamba` for all packages might be unnecessary. Initial hypothesis: the script might be over-provisioning with conda packages when system binaries are available. Refactoring the environment creation involves installing a minimal base environment with `micromamba` (Python, qe, and cmake) followed by the required scientific Python packages using `pip`. Subsequently, building LAMMPS can leverage the system compilers and the newly created `cmake` in the environment.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"#!/bin/bash\n# ==============================================================================\n# setup_local_rtx5080_env.sh\n# 新PC (Core Ultra 9 285K / RAM 64GB / RTX 5080 16GB / Windows 11 Pro WSL2) 用\n# root権限 (sudo) 不要の高速セットアップスクリプト\n# ==============================================================================\nset -e\n\nSCRIPT_DIR=\"$(cd \"$(dirname \"${BASH_SOURCE[0]}\")\" && pwd)\"\nWORKSPACE_DIR=\"$(dirname \"$SCRIPT_DIR\")\"\nENV_PREFIX=\"/home/WORKSTATION4WSL/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/mdi_env_rtx5080\"\nMAMBA_ROOT=\"/home/WORKSTATION4WSL/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/micromamba\"\nMAMBA_BIN=\"$MAMBA_ROOT/bin/micromamba\"\nLOCAL_BIN=\"$SCRIPT_DIR/bin\"\nmkdir -p \"$MAMBA_ROOT/bin\" \"$LOCAL_BIN\"\n\necho \"============================================================\"\necho \" Step 1: Micromamba パッケージマネージャの確認 (sudo 不要)\"\necho \"============================================================\"\nif [ ! -x \"$MAMBA_BIN\" ]; then\n    curl -Ls https://micro.mamba.pm/api/micromamba/linux-64/latest | tar -xvj -C \"$MAMBA_ROOT/bin\" --strip-components=1 bin/micromamba\n    chmod +x \"$MAMBA_BIN\"\nfi\necho \"✅ Micromamba ready: $MAMBA_BIN\"\n\necho \"============================================================\"\necho \" Step 2: Quantum ESPRESSO (pw.x) & Python 3.11 & CMake の高速導入\"\necho \"============================================================\"\nif [ ! -x \"$ENV_PREFIX/bin/pw.x\" ]; then\n    rm -rf \"$ENV_PREFIX\"\n    \"$MAMBA_BIN\" create -y -p \"$ENV_PREFIX\" -c conda-forge \\\n        python=3.11 pip cmake qe\nelse\n    echo \"✅ Quantum ESPRESSO ($ENV_PREFIX/bin/pw.x) already installed.\"\nfi\n\nexport PATH=\"$LOCAL_BIN:$ENV_PREFIX/bin:$PATH\"\nexport LD_LIBRARY_PATH=\"$ENV_PREFIX/lib:${LD_LIBRARY_PATH:-}\"\n\necho \"============================================================\"\necho \" Step 3: Python パッケージ (NumPy, SciPy, Matplotlib, ASE, PyMDI) の導入\"\necho \"============================================================\"\n\"$ENV_PREFIX/bin/pip\" install --quiet numpy scipy matplotlib ase pymdi\necho \"✅ Python packages (ase, pymdi, numpy, scipy, matplotlib) installed.\"\n\necho \"============================================================\"\necho \" Step 4: 論文・Word グラフ用フォント (MS明朝 / Times New Roman) 配置\"\necho \"============================================================\"\nfor f in \"$WORKSPACE_DIR/msmincho.ttc\" \"$WORKSPACE_DIR/times.ttf\" \"$WORKSPACE_DIR/環境設定・フォント/msmincho.ttc\" \"$WORKSPACE_DIR/環境設定・フォント/times.ttf\"; do\n    if [ -f \"$f\" ]; then\n        cp \"$f\" \"$SCRIPT_DIR/\" 2>/dev/null || true\n    fi\ndone\necho \"✅ Fonts copied to calculation directory.\"\n\necho \"============================================================\"\necho \" Step 5: LAMMPS (PKG_MDI=ON) の 24スレッド高速ビルド (Core Ultra 9 285K)\"\necho \"============================================================\"\nif [ ! -x \"$LOCAL_BIN/lmp\" ]; then\n    BUILD_ROOT=\"/home/WORKSTATION4WSL/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/lammps_mdi_build\"\n    mkdir -p \"$BUILD_ROOT\"\n    if [ ! -d \"$BUILD_ROOT/lammps\" ]; then\n        git clone --depth 1 -b release https://github.com/lammps/lammps.git \"$BUILD_ROOT/lammps\"\n    fi\n    rm -rf \"$BUILD_ROOT/lammps/build\"\n    mkdir -p \"$BUILD_ROOT/lammps/build\"\n    cd \"$BUILD_ROOT/lammps/build\"\n    \"$ENV_PREFIX/bin/cmake\" ../cmake \\\n        -DCMAKE_C_COMPILER=/usr/bin/gcc \\\n        -DCMAKE_CXX_COMPILER=/usr/bin/g++ \\\n        -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release \\\n        -DBUILD_MPI=OFF \\\n        -DBUILD_OMP=ON \\\n        -DPKG_MDI=ON \\\n        -DPKG_MANYBODY=ON\n    \"$ENV_PREFIX/bin/cmake\" --build . -j 24\n    cp lmp \"$LOCAL_BIN/lmp\"\n    cp lmp \"$ENV_PREFIX/bin/lmp\"\n    echo \"✅ LAMMPS (PKG_MDI=ON) built and installed to $LOCAL_BIN/lmp\"\nelse\n    echo \"✅ LAMMPS ($LOCAL_BIN/lmp) already built.\"\nfi\n\nln -sf \"$ENV_PREFIX/bin/pw.x\" \"$LOCAL_BIN/pw.x\"\n\necho \"============================================================\"\necho \" 🎉 セットアップ完了！\"\necho \"  - Python : $(which python3)\"\necho \"  - pw.x   : $(which pw.x)\"\necho \"  - lmp    : $(which lmp)\"\necho \"============================================================\"\n","Overwrite":true,"Path":"/home/WORKSTATION4WSL/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/mdi_workspace_backup/calc_2H-SiC_10-10_2periods_vac5A_local_RTX5080/setup_local_rtx5080_env.sh"}}]}
